",\\\"p\\\",\\\"A website enquiry is non-binding. A contract is formed only after the traveller receives and accepts an individual offer or booking confirmation containing the essential travel services, total price and contractual documents.\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"A website enquiry is non-binding. A contract is formed only after the traveller receives and accepts an individual offer or booking confirmation containing the essential travel services, total price and contractual documents.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n7:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"3. Travel services and price\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"3. Travel services and price\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-5 space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"The scope of services is determined by the specific itinerary, offer and booking confirmation. Passport, visa, insurance, personal expenses and gratuities are included only when expressly stated.\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"The scope of services is determined by the specific itinerary, offer and booking confirmation. Passport, visa, insurance, personal expenses and gratuities are included only when expressly stated.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n8:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"4. Payment and insolvency protection\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"4. Payment and insolvency protection\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-5 space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Add the valid deposit and final-payment rules. Where MEDYA TRAVEL is the organiser of a package travel contract, payments may be requested only in compliance with the statutory insolvency-protection requirements.\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Add the valid deposit and final-payment rules. Where MEDYA TRAVEL is the organiser of a package travel contract, payments may be requested only in compliance with the statutory insolvency-protection requirements.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\n9:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"5. Changes, cancellation and withdrawal\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"5. Changes, cancellation and withdrawal\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-5 space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Do not publish fixed cancellation charges until they have been legally drafted and economically calculated. Statutory traveller rights, including rights relating to unavoidable and extraordinary circumstances, remain unaffected.\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"Do not publish fixed cancellation charges until they have been legally drafted and economically calculated. Statutory traveller rights, including rights relating to unavoidable and extraordinary circumstances, remain unaffected.\\\"}]]}]]}]\\na:[\\\"$\\\",\\\"section\\\",\\\"6. Traveller obligations and defects\\\",{\\\"className\\\":\\\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\\\",\\\"childr\"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"en\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"h2\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\\\",\\\"children\\\":\\\"6. Traveller obligations and defects\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"div\\\",null,{\\\"className\\\":\\\"mt-5 space-y-4\\\",\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"p\\\",\\\"Travellers should promptly report defects and allow reasonable remedial action. Statutory rights under German package-travel 