ressly stated.\"}]]}]]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"section\",\"4. Payment and insolvency protection\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"4. Payment and insolvency protection\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Add the valid deposit and final-payment rules. Where MEDYA TRAVEL is the organiser of a package travel contract, payments may be requested only in compliance with the statutory insolvency-protection requirements.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Add the valid deposit and final-payment rules. Where MEDYA TRAVEL is the organiser of a package travel contract, payments may be requested only in compliance with the statutory insolvency-protection requirements.\"}]]}]]}]\n9:[\"$\",\"section\",\"5. Changes, cancellation and withdrawal\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"5. Changes, cancellation and withdrawal\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Do not publish fixed cancellation charges until they have been legally drafted and economically calculated. Statutory traveller rights, including rights relating to unavoidable and extraordinary circumstances, remain unaffected.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Do not publish fixed cancellation charges until they have been legally drafted and economically calculated. Statutory traveller rights, including rights relating to unavoidable and extraordinary circumstances, remain unaffected.\"}]]}]]}]\na:[\"$\",\"section\",\"6. Traveller obligations and defects\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"6. Traveller obligations and defects\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Travellers should promptly report defects and allow reasonable remedial action. Statutory rights under German package-travel law remain unaffected.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Travellers should promptly report defects and allow reasonable remedial action. Statutory rights under German package-travel law remain unaffected.\"}]]}]]}]\nb:[\"$\",\"section\",\"7. Passport, visa, health and insurance\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"7. Passport, visa, health and insurance\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"The pre-contractual information must state applicable passport, visa and health requirements. Travellers remain responsible for complying with requirements applicable to their nationality unless the contract expressly provides otherwise.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"The pre-contractual information must state applicable passport, visa and health requirements. Travellers remain responsible for complying with requirements applicable to their nationality unless the contract expressly provides otherwise.\"}]]}]]}]\nc:[\"$\",\"section\",\"8. Final provisions\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"8. Final provisions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Add applicable-law, jurisdiction, severability and consumer-dispute wording only after legal review and in a form compatible with mandatory consumer-protection law.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Add applicable-law, jurisdiction, severability and 