}],[\"$\",\"$L3\",null,{\"locale\":\"en\",\"languagePaths\":{\"en\":\"/en/legal/terms\",\"de\":\"/de/agb\",\"ar\":\"/ar/legal/terms\"}}],[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"min-h-screen bg-brand pb-24 pt-36\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"article\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-gold\",\"children\":\"MEDYA TRAVEL\"}],[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 font-serif text-5xl text-white sm:text-6xl\",\"children\":\"General Terms and Conditions\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-sm text-white/40\",\"children\":\"Draft status: July 2026\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-10 border-s-4 border-gold bg-gold/10 p-5 text-sm leading-7 text-white/80\",\"children\":\"This draft is not a substitute for travel-law advice. It must be completed and approved by a German lawyer before it is used for bookings.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-12 space-y-10\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"section\",\"1. Scope and contracting party\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"1. Scope and contracting party\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"These terms are intended for travel services offered by MEDYA TRAVEL. Add the full legal identity and clarify whether MEDYA TRAVEL acts as tour operator, travel agent or provider of linked travel arrangements for each offer.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"These terms are intended for travel services offered by MEDYA TRAVEL. Add the full legal identity and clarify whether MEDYA TRAVEL acts as tour operator, travel agent or provider of linked travel arrangements for each offer.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"2. Formation of contract\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"2. Formation of contract\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"A website enquiry is non-binding. A contract is formed only after the traveller receives and accepts an individual offer or booking confirmation containing the essential travel services, total price and contractual documents.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"A website enquiry is non-binding. A contract is formed only after the traveller receives and accepts an individual offer or booking confirmation containing the essential travel services, total price and contractual documents.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"3. Travel services and price\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"3. Travel services and price\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"The scope of services is determined by the specific itinerary, offer and booking confirmation. Passport, visa, insurance, personal expenses and gratuities are included only when expressly stated.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"The scope of services is determined by the specific itinerary, offer and booking confirmation. Passport, visa, insurance, personal expenses and gratuities are included only when expressly stated.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"4. Payment and insolvency protection\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"4. Payment and insolvency protection\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Add the valid deposit and final-payment rules. Where MEDYA TRAVEL is the organiser of a package travel contract, payments may be requested only in compliance with the statutory insolvency-protection requirements.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Add the valid deposit and final-payment rules. Where MEDYA TRAVEL is the organiser of a package travel contract, payments may be requested only in compliance with the statutory insolvency-protection requirements.\"}]]}]]}],\"$L4\",\"$L5\",\"$L6\",\"$L7\"]}]]}]}],\"$L8\",\"$L9\"]}],[\"$La\"],\"$Lb\"]}],\"isPartial\":false,\"staleTime\":300,\"varyParams\":null,\"buildId\":\"Gn8anLgfWa_hZB6svNdV-\"}\n4:[\"$\",\"section\",\"5. Changes, cancellation and withdrawal\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"5. Changes, cancellation and withdrawal\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Do not publish fixed cancellation charges until they have been legally drafted and economically calculated. Statutory traveller rights, including rights relating to unavoidable and extraordinary circumstances, remain unaffected.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Do not publish fixed cancellation charges until they have been legally drafted and economically calculated. Statutory traveller rights, including rights relating to unavoidable and extraordinary circumstances, remain unaffected.\"}]]}]]}]\n5:[\"$\",\"section\",\"6. Traveller obligations and defects\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"6. Traveller obligations and defects\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Travellers should promptly report defects and allow reasonable remedial action. Statutory rights under German package-travel law remain unaffected.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Travellers should promptly report defects and allow reasonable remedial action. Statutory rights under German package-travel law remain unaffected.\"}]]}]]}]\n6:[\"$\",\"section\",\"7. Passport, visa, health and insurance\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"7. Passport, visa, health and insurance\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"The pre-contractual information must state applicable passport, visa and health requirements. Travellers remain responsible for complying with requirements applicable to their nationality unless the contract expressly provides otherwise.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"The pre-contractual information must state applicable passport, visa and health requirements. Travellers remain responsible for complying with requirements applicable to their nationality unless the contract expressly provides otherwise.\"}]]}]]}]\n7:[\"$\",\"section\",\"8. Final provisions\",{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"font-serif text-3xl text-white\",\"children\":\"8. Final provisions\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 space-y-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"Add applicable-law, jurisdiction, severability and consumer-dispute wording only after legal review and in a form compatible with mandatory consumer-protection law.\",{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-8 text-light-gray sm:text-base\",\"children\":\"Add applicable-law, jurisdiction, severability and consumer-dispute wording only after legal review and in a form compatible with mandatory consumer-protection law.\"}]]}]]}]\n8:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"id\":\"book\",\"className\":\"relative overflow-hidden border-t border-white/10 bg-brand py-14 sm:py-20\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"aria-hi